  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n5 − 10 ÷ 5 × 2 − [12 ÷ 6 of {5 × 6 ÷ (6 − 9) + 13} × (8 ÷ 4 of 3)]\n\n**Concept Used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/3305d1b4a7bb3b86642c9894fef0a1ecbe2118013586d747a3eba9fcd0053a7f.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 5 − 10 ÷ 5 × 2 − [12 ÷ 6 of {5 × 6 ÷ (6 − 9) + 13} × (8 ÷ 4 of 3)]\n\n⇒ 5 − 10 ÷ 5 × 2 − [12 ÷ 6 of {5 × 6 ÷ (6 − 9) + 13} × (8 ÷ 12)]\n\n⇒ 5 − 10 ÷ 5 × 2 − [12 ÷ 6 of {5 × 6 ÷ (–3) + 13} × 2/3]\n\n⇒ 5 − 10 ÷ 5 × 2 − [12 ÷ 6 of {5 × (–2) + 13} × 2/3]\n\n⇒ 5 – 10 ÷ 5 × 2 – [12 ÷ (6 × 3) × 2/3]\n\n⇒ 5 – 10 ÷ 5 × 2 – [12 × 1/18 × 2/3]\n\n⇒ 5 – 10 ÷ 5 × 2 – 4/9\n\n⇒ 5 – 2 × 2 – 4/9\n\n⇒ 5 – 4 – 4/9 \n\n⇒ 1 – 4/9 = 5/9\n\n**Hence, the simplified value of the expression is 5/9**",
